 "Learn: ultimate (W + I)": "习得：终极技（W + I）",
 "+2 stat points": "+2 属性点",
 "The ending": "结局",
 "J / Enter: begin": "J / Enter：开始",
 "J / Enter: free roam": "J / Enter：自由探索",
 "J / Enter: keep going": "J / Enter：继续",
 "J / Enter: next    Esc: skip": "J / Enter：下一页    Esc：跳过",
 "THE END": "终",
 "ALL SIX SAVIOURS": "六位救世者",
 "THE PACT HOLDS": "盟约长存",
 "Six went up into the Crown while three layers held the ground beneath them. Thunder, song, fire, wind, earth and water fell as one blow. The sky is quiet now. Aurelia, the Surface and Deepline stand. Thank you for playing.": "六人登上王冠，三层大地在他们脚下坚守。雷、歌、火、风、土、水化作同一击落下。天空如今安静了。奥蕾莉亚、地表与深线依然屹立。感谢游玩。",
 "The Hollow Crown fell into the Crater and the Legion went still, like an army at last allowed to rest. {0}'s story is told.": "空冠坠入陨坑，军团静止下来，像一支终于获准歇息的军队。{0}的故事讲完了。",
 "Another hero, another story: New Game > The Hollow Crown.": "换一位英雄，换一个故事：新游戏 > 空冠。",
 "THE THREE-LAYER WAR IS OVER": "三层之战结束了",
 "THE CONVERGENCE": "交汇",
 "THE BIG WAR BEGINS": "大战开始",
 "Four banners climbed the Halcyon Spire, and on the floor of his own Engine the Director fell.": "四面旗帜攀上哈尔西恩尖塔，总监倒在了他自己的引擎之上。",
 "He stepped back into its light the way a man steps into the sea. What walked out was the Convergence.": "他退回那片光里，像一个人走进大海。走出来的，是交汇。",
 "It opened the Beyond as wide as the sky and called into the dark. Over the Crater, the heavens split along a seam.": "它把彼岸撕开得像天空一样宽，朝黑暗中呼唤。陨坑上空，天幕沿着一道接缝裂开。",
 "Sovereign Vael answered. Behind him came the Hollow Legion, hundreds of thousands strong, emptied out of every world he has eaten, and fourteen champions born beyond the dark.": "君主维尔回应了。他身后跟来空洞军团，数十万之众，掏空自他吞噬过的每一个世界，还有十四名生于黑暗彼岸的勇士。",
 "2091. The Ashfall War burns the world down in forty-one days.\nThe rich climb into the sky and call it Aurelia,\na city of gold held up on humming pylons.\nThe poor go down into the dead metro and call it Deepline.\nEveryone else is left on the Surface, with the ash.": "2091年。落灰战争在四十一天里烧毁了世界。\n富人爬上天空，称之为奥蕾莉亚，\n一座由嗡鸣塔柱托起的黄金之城。\n穷人钻进死去的地铁，称之为深线。\n其余的人留在地表，与灰烬为伴。",
 "A handful of families will not choose.\nAround a fire on a mountain they swear the Pact of Three Layers:\nto live in the sky, on the ground and under it,\nand keep the three from killing one another.\nA monk rings a bell over the oath. He has not spoken since.": "有几户人家不肯选边。\n他们在山上围着篝火立下三层之约：\n在天上、地面与地下生活，\n并让三层不至于自相残杀。\n一位僧人为誓言敲响了钟。此后他再未开口。",
 "2187. Halcyon wakes the Convergence Engine.\nIt tears two worlds into ours: Vharra, the storm steppe,\nand the Frozen Harbour. Their people fall into all three layers.\nThey remember everything. Every name. Every grave.": "2187年。哈尔西恩唤醒了交汇引擎。\n它把两个世界撕进我们的世界：风暴草原瓦拉，\n与冰封港湾。那里的人落入了全部三层。\n他们记得一切。每一个名字。每一座坟墓。",
 "The Engine tears one more hole, into the Beyond,\nthe dark between the worlds, and the hole never heals.\nHalcyon hunts anyone with power, gives them a number,\nand feeds them to the Engine. What comes back is a Husk.": "引擎又撕开了一个洞，通向彼岸，\n世界之间的黑暗，而那个洞再也没有愈合。\n哈尔西恩追捕一切拥有力量的人，给他们编号，\n再把他们喂给引擎。回来的，只是空壳。",
 "Something faceless crawls through that hole and learns to wear us.\nAnd far beyond it, in the dark,\nsomething vast hears the Engine turning, and turns toward it.": "某个没有脸的东西从那个洞里爬了出来，学会了披上我们的模样。\n而在遥远的彼方，在黑暗里，\n某个庞然之物听见引擎转动，转身朝它而来。",
 "Forty-eight heroes. Forty-eight stories. One war.\nChoose who you will be.": "四十八位英雄。四十八个故事。一场战争。\n选择你将成为谁。",
