 "J: begin    Esc: back": "J：开始    Esc：返回",
 "Arrows: choose    U / I: realm    J: play    Esc: back": "方向键：选择    U / I：国度    J：开始    Esc：返回",
 "One of the six saviours. Finish 8 stories, at least 2 from each layer (now {0}: Aurelia {1}, Surface {2}, Deepline {3}).": "六位救世者之一。完成8个故事，每层至少2个（当前{0}个：奥蕾莉亚{1}，地表{2}，深线{3}）。",
