 "Face Itsuki (E)": "直面一树（E）",
 "Cut through the Hollow Legion": "杀穿空洞军团",
 "Break the Legion's last assault": "击溃军团最后的进攻",
 "Hold the Crater against the Legion": "在陨坑抵挡军团",
 "Stand in Itsuki's way (E)": "挡住一树的去路（E）",
