 "Every screen in the world shows the same two films. A white-haired Deepline boy opens the Core Sump's vents onto the Sky's laboratories. A singer from the Sky leads Halcyon's drills into Deepline's tunnels.": "世上每一块屏幕都在放同样的两段影像。一个深线的白发少年打开核心污水坑的排气口，对准天空城的实验室。一个来自天空城的歌者，领着哈尔西恩的钻机钻进深线的隧道。",
 "Each layer believes the other struck first. Three battles begin on the same night: the Siege of the Noble Ring, the Drills at the Buried Meridian, and the Pit Arena, where someone has been pulling strings for years.": "每一层都以为是对方先动的手。三场战斗在同一夜打响：贵族环区之围、被掩埋的子午线的钻机之战，还有深坑竞技场——那里有人已经牵了好多年的线。",
 "The faces are real. The people behind them are not.": "脸是真的。脸后面的人不是。",
 "I've outrun worse than you. Then I turned round and hit it, too.": "比你可怕的东西我都甩开过。然后我转过身，照样揍了它。",
