 "He raises the bell. Once at every dawn, always once. Today he rings it three times.": "他举起钟。每个黎明一下，向来只有一下。今天，他敲了三下。",
 "Halcyon keeps its Subjects coldest in Cryo Vault 9. The eldest of them minds only the glass.": "哈尔西恩把实验体关在最冷的9号冷冻库。其中最年长的那位，只恨那些玻璃。",
 "Home can wait a while. Up. Show me this city from above, now that it belongs to us.": "家可以再等等。飞吧。从高处带我看看这座城，如今它属于我们了。"
